{
  "_comment": [
    "Phrase lists for ticfinder. Dropped in the current directory or beside",
    "the script, this is picked up automatically. Override with --phrases.",
    "",
    "Grouped by WHY the phrase is a problem, not alphabetically, because the",
    "groups are what you mute. Each group becomes its own construction id and",
    "gets its own row in the summary, so you can see which kind of overuse",
    "dominates your writing.",
    "",
    "confidence is high | med | low and only affects colour and ordering.",
    "match_lemma: true matches inflected forms (leverage/leverages/leveraged).",
    "Phrases are matched as token sequences, case-insensitively."
  ],
